      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update: rebooting, relaunching everything, and retesting in the same five worlds, can no longer replicate.\n\nThe extraneous colon is still in the menu, but avatar resizing works like normal now. As best I can tell, the sequence of events seems to be:\n\n1. Working as normal\n\n2. Enter world with avatar height limit: limits work as normal\n\n3. Enter other worlds without height limits: avatar height limit from that first world is still in effect\n\n4. Changing worlds does not correct problem. The limit persists across all worlds.\n\n5. Rebooting and restarting VR, problem does not recur.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
